    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d55">

                <pb facs="0159" n="47" sameAs="frus:frus1918/pg47"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 832.73/101</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the Chargé in Brazil</hi> (<hi
                        rendition="#italic">Benson</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1917-04-14T18:00:00-05:00">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">April 14, 1917, 6 p.m.</hi>
                        </date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Referring to Embassy’s despatch No 878, March 20, and Department’s telegram of
                    March 22, 4 p.m., Department desires to learn by cable what progress is being
                    made in solution of difficulty referred to therein.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Lansing</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
